,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":7270.424243476,"data":"4. Mountain Gorilla (Gorilla beringei beringei)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":7270.42424805,"data":"5. Sumatran Elephant (Elephas maximus sumatrae)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":7270.424251597,"data":"6. Bornean Orangutan (Panulid apes orangutans)\n"}
